# --- Private to this machine ---
# This repository is published as a worked example of the converter and the
# player. It is not the home of the prototype archive, the project's planning
# notes, or any tooling state. Anyone using it brings their own .prd files.
.claude/
.code-review-graph/
.codegraph/
docs/
history/
protos/

# --- Local machine config ---
.serve.json

# --- The published player ---
# Everything under out/ is deployed to prototypes.mablahblah.com, so all of it
# is committed: the list page, the pages rebuilt from .prd files, and the ones
# written by hand. None of it contains the original file paths that the .prd
# source files carry, because the converter keeps only the image data.

# --- Secrets and credentials ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keychain
credentials.json
secrets.json
*.secret

